  IncidentDetails:
    isNegative: 0
    incidentName: Fruit Trees
    chanceToHappen: 40
    incidentDescription: 'Whilst traveling, your caravan is forced to take a detour
      as the main road seems to be blocked by landslide. The side trail your caravan
      takes is narrow and made from simple hardly packed dirt, and so the going is
      both slower and rougher.  However this turns out to be a boon as partway along
      the track your caravan spots several fruit trees right by the road, and despite
      not being quite the correct time of year, the trees seem to be full, weighed
      down by their delicious bounty.   Your caravan stops for a short time as its
      members fill both buckets and their bellies with freshly fallen fruit, or climb
      the boughs to reach those still hanging from the branches. '
    incidentTypeId: 0
    incidentImage: {fileID: 0}
